.Dd June 5, 2026
.Dt OCIFBSD-LOGD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ocifbsd-logd
.Nd ocifbsd log aggregation and forwarding daemon
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl f
.Op Fl c Ar config_file
.Op Fl l Ar log_level
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
daemon aggregates, stores, forwards, and alerts on log entries
produced by the
.Xr ocifbsd 8
OCI runtime and the jails it manages.
It keeps the most recent entries in a bounded in-memory ring
buffer, rotates them to disk on a schedule, forwards copies to
configured external endpoints, and evaluates alert rules that
may invoke webhooks, send email, or run an administrator-defined
command.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl f
Run in the foreground.
The default is to daemonize via
.Xr daemon 3 .
.It Fl c Ar config_file
Load
.Ar config_file
instead of the default
.Pa /etc/ocifbsd/ocifbsd.conf .
The configuration controls ring-buffer size, retention
windows, forwarder destinations, and alert rules.
.It Fl l Ar log_level
Set the minimum severity captured by the daemon.
Valid levels are
.Dq emerg , alert , crit , err , warning , notice , info , debug ,
and
.Dq trace .
.El
.Pp
The daemon handles
.Dv SIGTERM
and
.Dv SIGINT
for graceful shutdown and
.Dv SIGHUP
to reload the configuration file.
.Ss Subsystems
.Bl -bullet
.It
An in-memory ring buffer
.Pq ringbuf.c
backs the query API and is the source of truth for recent
entries.
.It
A background rotation worker
.Pq rotation_worker
writes the current ring contents to timestamped files under
.Pa /var/log/ocifbsd
and applies the configured retention policy.
.It
A forward worker
.Pq forward_worker
periodically delivers new entries to every enabled
forwarder (syslog over UDP/TCP, fluentd, Elasticsearch,
Splunk, or a custom HTTP webhook) using
.Xr libcurl 3 .
.It
An alert worker
.Pq alert_worker
evaluates incoming entries against the alert rule tree and
fires actions when a rule's count threshold is reached
within its time window.
.It
An event stream
.Pq event_publish , event_query
records lifecycle events for pods, containers, nodes, and
cluster members and dispatches them to registered webhooks.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /var/log/ocifbsd -compact
.It Pa /etc/ocifbsd/ocifbsd.conf
Default configuration file.
.It Pa /var/log/ocifbsd
Default storage path for rotated log files
.Pq Dq config.storage_path .
.It Pa /var/log/ocifbsd/ocifbsd.YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.log
Rotated log file produced by
.Cm log_rotate .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ocifbsd 8 ,
.Xr daemon 3 ,
.Xr curl 3 ,
.Xr syslog 3
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
command first appeared in
.Fx 16.0 .
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
utility was developed by
.An REVYTECH, Inc.
